ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang Feng participates in the school's art exhibition. After the exhibition ends, he leaves his sketchbook in the classroom, but mistakenly thinks he puts it back in his backpack. At night, his mother asks, \"Where is your sketchbook?\" Zhang Feng replies, \"I put it back in my backpack, Mom.\"\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Zhang Feng say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhang Feng forgets he leaves the sketchbook in the classroom.\nB. Zhang Feng intentionally lies because he does not want his mother to worry.\nC. Zhang Feng wants to test if his mother cares about his sketchbook.\nD. Zhang Feng remembers the sketchbook is in his backpack.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003593458912384694,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52abcc2ddb05a7fe2eca4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452156517,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:55:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"d5939332ecee458e9e8c1088a95e8cd1"}